id: enhanced-search
name: Enhanced Search
talentCategory: skill
prerequisites: 2+ Skill Ranks in the Clairvoyance Skill and/or Perception Skill
# (4) "Ignore the effects of the Blinded Combat Condition and the Obscured Environmental Quality" (registry.mjs).
ignoresConditions: blinded
ignoresQualities: obscured
description: >
  Whether through advanced ki sensory techniques or highly refined senses, nothing escapes your notice.
text: >
  Enhanced Search: Whether through advanced ki sensory techniques or highly refined senses, nothing escapes your notice.
  –Prerequisites: 2+ Skill Ranks in the Clairvoyance Skill and/or Perception Skill
  (1)-[Passive]: When making a Clairvoyance or Perception Skill Check/Clash, you may use the higher Skill Bonus between the two Skills.
  (2)-[Triggered]: If you win the Skill Clash for the Sense Maneuver, you become aware of their Alignment.
  (3)-[Passive]: Your Perception Skill Checks are unaffected by the Light Level.
  (4)-[Passive]: You may ignore the effects of the Blinded Combat Condition and the Obscured Environmental Quality.
  (5)-[Triggered/Start of Turn, Ruling, 1/Round]: Target a Character. Make a Clash (Perception/Clairvoyance vs Stealth/Concealment) against that Character. If you win, that Character becomes ‘Marked’ until the start of your next turn. Increase your Strike and Dodge Rolls against a ‘Marked’ Character by 1(T) and a ‘Marked’ Character cannot become Hidden from you.

---

[passive]
# (1) Each of the two rolled with the higher Skill Bonus of them (actor-character.mjs, where each Skill's roll is put together).
allow senses.higherBonus;
# (2) A won Sense: their Alignment too, in what is whispered to you (chat.mjs settleSense).
allow sense.alignment;
# (3) Read on the Light Levels' own files: their Perception line left out for whoever holds this Talent.

# (5) On your turn's card, the player's to choose: which Character, then the Clash; won, Marked (a mark) on them till the start
# of your next turn, on your clock - your Strike and Dodge 1(T) against them, and Hidden from you they cannot become
# (chat.mjs enhancedMark, settleSearchMark, markedParts; hidden.mjs hideFrom).
[triggered/start-of-turn, 1/round, chosen, effect 5]
enhancedMark();
